# Where the WhoOwes server lives. The URL is baked into builds, so set it before building.
#   Local server, testing on your phone: http://<your computer's Wi-Fi IP>:4000  (not localhost)
#   Production (Render):                 https://<your-service>.onrender.com
# Leave empty to run the self-contained demo on sample data.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=

# Google Play subscriptions: RevenueCat → Project settings → API keys → Google Play
# public SDK key (starts with goog_). Not secret. Also add it to both profiles in eas.json.
# Without it, phone builds show paid plans as "coming soon".
EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_ANDROID_KEY=
# Later, for iPhone (starts with appl_).
EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_IOS_KEY=
